| description = Faction of the [[Velious]] [[dwarves]] who reside in [[Thurgadin]]. They are enemies of the [[Kromrif]] and [[Kromzek]] giants, especially the [[Kromrif]] who hunt them in the wastes. They have little contact with the [[Claws of Veeshan]] nor the [[Tunarean Court]]. Their king, [[Dain Frostreaver IV]], has his own faction. An isolated community of related dwarves, [[Citizens of Froststone]] resides in [[Crystal Caverns]].

Kindly faction is required for all [[Thurgadin Armor Quests]].

